# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
# RKF — Docker build context excludes
# infra/docker/Dockerfile.{api,web} both `COPY . .` in their build stage —
# keep this list to things the build genuinely doesn't need. Must NOT
# exclude: pnpm-lock.yaml, pnpm-workspace.yaml, package.json files,
# tsconfig*.json, apps/, packages/, apps/web/public, apps/web/index.html,
# infra/docker/nginx.conf.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

# Dependencies — reinstalled from the lockfile in the deps stage
**/node_modules

# Build outputs — regenerated in the build stage
**/dist

# VCS
.git

# Test artifacts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage

# Turbo cache
.turbo
**/.turbo

# Logs
*.log

# Environment files — never bake secrets into an image
.env*
!.env.example

# Docs / prompts / IaC — not needed to build or run the app images
docs
prompts
infra/terraform
